# AI indexing exclusions
# Keep source, tests, documentation, and checked-in project configuration available.

# Build, test, coverage, and package output
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/[Dd]ebug/
**/[Rr]elease/
**/[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
**/[Cc]overage[Rr]eport*/
**/artifacts/
**/packages/
*.nupkg
*.snupkg

# Workspace scratch files and editor-generated reports
/.tmp/
/.tmp-*/
.VSCodeCounter/
.vs/
.idea/
*.tmp
*.temp

# Runtime state, private account cache, backups, and diagnostics
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-*
**/*.sqlite3
**/cache-backups/
**/SWGOHCommandBridge/
**/diagnostics/
**/comlink/
**/settings.json
*.log
*.dmp

# Local configuration and credentials
.env
.env.*
**/secrets.json
**/*secret*.json
**/*credentials*.json

# Generated source and metadata
**/*.generated.cs
**/*.g.cs
**/*.designer.cs
**/*.generated.json
